{"id":"n26866-1-5","stage":5,"title":"어민 · 渔民","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26866-1-5-1","ko":"나는 생선을 진짜 좋아해.","zh":"我真的很喜欢鱼。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"생선을","meaning":"鲜鱼，活鱼，鱼","explanation":"생선：鲜鱼，活鱼，鱼；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"생선","audio":"/audio/b8a4f11ece6e2014b309.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26850","senseId":"1","lemma":"생선","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생선을","audio":"/audio/d2236f7863f283829f2d.mp3"}},{"text":"진짜","meaning":"真的","explanation":"진짜：真的","readings":[{"term":"진짜","audio":"/audio/79eea25f740b5721caae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71539","senseId":"1","lemma":"진짜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"진짜","audio":"/audio/79eea25f740b5721caae.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아해.","meaning":"爱吃，爱喝","explanation":"좋아하다：爱吃，爱喝；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"3","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아해","audio":"/audio/ef5074f85cc0a689d2ec.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"b8a4f11ece6e2014","term":"생선","zh":"鲜鱼，活鱼，鱼","audio":"/audio/b8a4f11ece6e2014b309.mp3","entryId":"26850","definition":"刚抓捕上来的新鲜的鱼，以供食用。","pronunciation":["생선"]},{"id":"79eea25f740b5721","term":"진짜","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/79eea25f740b5721caae.mp3","entryId":"71539","definition":"没有假装或虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["진짜"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"爱吃，爱喝","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"特别喜欢吃或喝特定的食物。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9285e13c913089fdad2d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26866-1-5-2","ko":"이번에 어민들이 모여 사는 마을에 가면 실컷 먹을 수 있을 거야.","zh":"这次要是去渔民聚居的村子，应该能尽情吃鱼了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번에","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번에","audio":"/audio/46d83053c21d45a8f49f.mp3"}},{"text":"어민들이","meaning":"渔民，渔夫","explanation":"어민：渔民，渔夫；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"어민","audio":"/audio/f4e76ddedabf96b1286d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26866","senseId":"1","lemma":"어민","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어민들이","audio":"/audio/4198a2074241959f35da.mp3"}},{"text":"모여","meaning":"被召集，被集中","explanation":"모이다：被召集，被集中；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"모이다","audio":"/audio/ea6fae0a54340254cbe6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91162","senseId":"6","lemma":"모이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모여","audio":"/audio/d1223966775173ca1e95.mp3"}},{"text":"사는","meaning":"住，生活","explanation":"살다：住，生活；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"10","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사는","audio":"/audio/30f3407ddedb23e84811.mp3"}},{"text":"마을에","meaning":"村子，村庄","explanation":"마을：村子，村庄；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"마을","audio":"/audio/16a6e53889b32d5b72f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61099","senseId":"1","lemma":"마을","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마을에","audio":"/audio/15901f764c67b4def789.mp3"}},{"text":"가면","meani